-## Commands
-
-**Development server:**
-```bash
-dentc-env\Scripts\activate            # Windows  (source dentc-env/bin/activate on *nix)
-uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000
-#   docs http://localhost:8000/docs · spec http://localhost:8000/api/v1/openapi.json
