-`office_phone_assignments`, `account_holidays`, `account_consents`; Alembic
-`c3d4e5f6a7b8`) and routes under `/tenants/{tenant_id}/…`
-([app/api/v1/account.py](app/api/v1/account.py)): account-settings, logo,
